00:24:51.520 --> 00:24:54.370
But as you just saw, currently,
anyone on the internet

00:24:54.370 --> 00:24:56.290
can talk to either of
those functions, right?

00:24:56.290 --> 00:24:59.950
But we really want it such
that functionB can only

00:24:59.950 --> 00:25:01.768
be accessed by functionA.

00:25:01.768 --> 00:25:03.310
So over in the
service accounts page,

00:25:03.310 --> 00:25:07.120
I created functionA a thing
