So this is-- we announced
availability of our product

00:33:14.640 --> 00:33:18.510
for AWS, those guys,
back in September.

00:33:18.510 --> 00:33:21.360
We've been hard working at
getting the things that we

00:33:21.360 --> 00:33:22.922
do to do work well
on GCP and take

00:33:22.922 --> 00:33:24.630
advantage of some of
the cool things that

00:33:24.630 --> 00:33:26.580
are in this platform.

00:33:26.580 --> 00:33:29.830
