00:36:50.950 --> 00:36:53.920
But now that we shoved it
a little select text there

00:36:53.920 --> 00:36:55.990
as well, we're going
to magically get

00:36:55.990 --> 00:36:58.252
some data stuffed
into the database that

00:36:58.252 --> 00:37:00.710
shouldn't have been there, and
now we can pull it back out.

00:37:00.710 --> 00:37:01.810
So that was what Mike
described before,

00:37:01.810 --> 00:37:03.790
where we leveraged the
ability to do some injection.

00:37:03.790 --> 00:37:05.720
To put something into a database
