00:37:26.720 --> 00:37:28.240
So we now know,
hey, this thing is

00:37:28.240 --> 00:37:29.460
vulnerable to code injection.

00:37:29.460 --> 00:37:29.960
Cool.

00:37:29.960 --> 00:37:31.480
Let's see what other data
