00:37:37.700 --> 00:37:39.158
And what's it-- I
want to point out

00:37:39.158 --> 00:37:40.780
about that is, if
you saw earlier,

00:37:40.780 --> 00:37:42.850
this function shouldn't
be able to delete things.

00:37:42.850 --> 00:37:44.860
It doesn't need that permission,
but we gave it that permission

00:37:44.860 --> 00:37:46.960
and now the attacker can
