00:38:29.860 --> 00:38:30.290
I say hopefully.

00:38:30.290 --> 00:38:30.880
It's a video, right?

00:38:30.880 --> 00:38:31.963
You guys know how it ends.

00:38:35.650 --> 00:38:36.150
Here you go.

00:38:36.150 --> 00:38:37.080
So nothing happens
in the bottom.

00:38:37.080 --> 00:38:38.622
So we try that same
