00:38:45.098 --> 00:38:47.410
we can pop into the
logs for that function,

00:38:47.410 --> 00:38:50.047
and we can see what Protego
is logging into the logs

00:38:50.047 --> 00:38:51.880
of that function in
real time as it happens.

00:38:51.880 --> 00:38:54.420
And here you can see, if
