00:38:54.420 --> 00:38:56.820
what the event was,
what the pattern was,

00:38:56.820 --> 00:38:58.293
or event was that were blocking.

00:38:58.293 --> 00:39:00.210
And in this case, you
see the type of reaction

00:39:00.210 --> 00:39:02.140
was block, as opposed to what
would've been there before,

00:39:02.140 --> 00:39:02.765
which is alert.

00:39:02.765 --> 00:39:05.400
So we're actually detecting
and blocking in real time,

00:39:05.400 --> 00:39:07.390
as well as reporting it.

00:39:07.390 --> 00:39:07.990
So that's us.

00:39:07.990 --> 00:39:08.490
Cool.

